  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đúng. Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng. Với mọi  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"double-struck\">*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét hiệu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> với mọi  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"double-struck\">*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></semantics></math> với mọi  <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"double-struck\">*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy dãy số <math display